## 🏆 Competition Mode

For competitions, each team can:
- See other teams (transparency)
- Keep strategy private (don't share plans)
- Monitor overall performance

Set different topics for:
- **Public data**: `/team_X/devices/*/pose` (visible to all)
- **Private data**: `/team_X/internal/strategy` (not published)

